hadiths[107]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Jis ki namaz use behayai aur buri baton se na roke, us ki koi namaz nahin."
"2","[AI-translation] Jis ki namaz use behayai aur buri baton se na roke, woh Allah se door hone ke siwa kuch nahin badhta."
"3","[AI-translation] Masjid mein [laghw] baat karna nekiyon ko is tarah kha jata hai jaise maweshi ghaas khate hain."
"4","[AI-translation] Masjid mein baat karna nekiyon ko is tarah kha jata hai jaise aag lakdi ko khati hai."
"5","[AI-translation] Apni duniya ke liye aise amal karo jaise tum hamesha jeete rahoge, aur apni aakhirat ke liye aise amal karo jaise tum kal mar jaoge."
"6","[AI-translation] Main har muttaqi ke liye khair ka markaz hun."
"7","[AI-translation] Mujhe mu'allim bana kar bheja gaya hai."
"8","[AI-translation] Allah ne duniya ki taraf wahi farmai: Jo Meri khidmat kare us ki khidmat kar, aur jo teri khidmat kare use thaka de."
"9","[AI-translation] Khazra-ud-diman se bacho. Poocha gaya: Khazra-ud-diman kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Khoobsurat aurat jo bure mahol mein pali ho."
"10","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke do giroh hain: jab woh durust ho jaen to log durust ho jaenge; [woh] hukmaran aur fuqaha hain."
"12","[AI-translation] Mere martabe ke waseele se [Allah se] mango, kyunke Allah ke han mera martaba bahut azeem hai."
"13","[AI-translation] Jo apne ghar se namaz ke liye nikle aur kahe: Aey Allah! Main Tujh se Sawal karne walon ke haq ke waseele se aur apne is chalne ke haq ke waseele se mangta hun, aur main takabbur ya ghamand se nahin nikla; to Allah apne Wajh [rehmat] se us ki taraf mutawajjeh hota hai aur ek hazar farishte us ke liye maghfirat mangte hain."
"14","[AI-translation] Khair mujh mein hai aur qayamat tak meri ummat mein rahegi."
"15","[AI-translation] Jo asr ke baad soe phir us ki aql chheen li jae [pagal ho jae], to woh apne siwa kisi ko malamat na kare."
"16","[AI-translation] Jis ne hadas kiya aur wuzu na kiya us ne Mujh se jafa ki; jis ne wuzu kiya aur namaz na padhi us ne Mujh se jafa ki; jis ne namaz padhi aur Mujh se dua na mangi us ne Mujh se jafa ki; aur jis ne Mujh se dua mangi aur Main ne qubool na ki to Main ne us se jafa ki; halanke Main jafa karne wala Rabb nahin hun."
"17","[AI-translation] Jis ne Baitullah ka hajj kiya aur meri ziyarat na ki to us ne mujh se jafa ki."
"18","[AI-translation] Jis ne hajj kiya aur meri wafaat ke baad meri qabr ki ziyarat ki, to goya us ne meri zindagi mein meri ziyarat ki."
"19","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ikhtilaf rehmat hai."
"20","[AI-translation] Mere sahaba sitaron ki tarah hain; tum un mein se jis ki pairwi karoge hidayat pa jaoge."
"21","[AI-translation] Beshak mere sahaba sitaron ki tarah hain; un mein se jis ke qaul ko tum pakad loge hidayat pa jaoge."
"22","[AI-translation] Jis ne apne nafs ko pehchana us ne apne Rabb ko pehchana."
"23","[AI-translation] Mere Rabb ne mujhe adab sikhaya aur mere adab ko khoob sanwara."
"24","[AI-translation] Sab log murda hain siwae ilm walon ke; aur ilm wale sab halak hain siwae amal walon ke; aur amal wale sab doobe hue hain siwae mukhlis logon ke; aur mukhlis log bade khatre mein hain."
"25","[AI-translation] Momin ka bacha hua [khana] shifa hai."
"26","[AI-translation] Jab tum Khurasan ki taraf se kale jhande nikalte dekho to un ki taraf aao agarche ghutnon ke bal ghisat kar, kyunke un mein Allah ka khalifa Mahdi hai."
"27","[AI-translation] Tauba karne wala Allah ka mahboob hai."
"28","[AI-translation] Khabardar! Main bhoolta nahin, lekin mujhe bhulaya jata hai taake main shariat qayam karun."
"29","[AI-translation] Log soe hue hain; jab marenge to jaag jaenge."
"30","[AI-translation] Jo koi hadees bayan kare aur us waqt use chheenk aae to woh [hadees] sach hai."
"31","[AI-translation] Nikah karo aur talaq na do, kyunke talaq se Arsh hil jata hai."
"32","[AI-translation] Dirham ke barabar khoon [lagne] se namaz dohrai jaegi."
"33","[AI-translation] Sakhi Allah se qareeb hai, jannat se qareeb hai, logon se qareeb hai, jahannam se door hai; aur bakheel Allah se door hai, jannat se door hai, logon se door hai, jahannam se qareeb hai; aur jahil sakhi Allah ko bakheel aabid se ziyada mahboob hai."
"34","[AI-translation] Main Arabi hun, Quran Arabi hai, aur jannat walon ki zaban bhi Arabi hai."
"35","[AI-translation] Beshak har cheez ka dil hai, aur Quran ka dil [surah] Yasin hai; jo use padhe goya us ne Quran das martaba padha."
"36","[AI-translation] Ek ghadi ka fikr [ghaur] saath saal ki ibadat se behtar hai."
"37","[AI-translation] Masjid ke padosi ki namaz masjid ke siwa [ghar mein] nahin hoti."
"38","[AI-translation] Hajr-e-Aswad zameen par Allah ka dayan hath hai; us se Woh apne bandon se musafaha farmata hai."
"39","[AI-translation] Roza rakho sehatmand ho jaoge."
"40","[AI-translation] Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ne mujhe padosi ke bare mein chalis gharon tak waseeyat ki: is taraf se das, is taraf se das, is taraf se das, aur is taraf se das."
"41","[AI-translation] [Aey Nabi!] Agar Tum na hote to Main duniya ko paida na karta."
"42","[AI-translation] Jo har raat surah Waqi'ah padhe use kabhi faqa na pahunchega."
"43","[AI-translation] Jo subah kare aur us ki fikr Allah Azza wa Jalla ke siwa kuch aur ho to us ka Allah se koi talluq nahin; aur jo Musalmanon ki fikr na kare woh un mein se nahin."
"44","[AI-translation] Jaise tum hoge waise hi hukmaran tum par muqarrar kiye jaenge."
"45","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla shabaan ki pandrahwin raat aasman-e-duniya par nuzool farmata hai aur Banu Kalb ki bakrion ke balon ki ta'dad se ziyada logon ko bakhsh deta hai."
"46","[AI-translation] Kya tum janti ho yeh kaunsi raat hai? Yani shabaan ki pandrahwin raat. Unhon ne poocha: Is mein kya hota hai Ya Rasulullah? To Aap ne farmaya: Is mein is saal paida hone wale har bachche ka likha jata hai, is mein is saal marne wale har shakhs ka likha jata hai, is mein un ke a'mal uthae jate hain, aur is mein un ke rizq utare jate hain."
"47","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah shabaan ki pandrahwin raat [rehmat se] tawajjoh farmata hai aur mushrik ya [bila wajah] bughz rakhne wale ke siwa apni tamam makhlooq ko bakhsh deta hai."
"48","[AI-translation] Jab shabaan ki pandrahwin raat aae to us ki raat mein qiyam karo aur din mein roza rakho; kyunke Allah us mein ghurub-e-aftab se aasman-e-duniya par nuzool farmata hai aur elan farmata hai: Khabardar! Hai koi Mujh se maghfirat mangne wala ke Main use bakhsh dun; khabardar! Hai koi Mujh se rizq mangne wala ke Main use rizq dun; khabardar! Hai koi museebat-zada ke Main use aafiyat dun; khabardar! Hai falan, khabardar! Hai falan; yahan tak ke fajr tulu ho jae."
"49","[AI-translation] Paanch raaten aisi hain jin mein dua radd nahin hoti: Rajab ki pehli raat, shabaan ki pandrahwin raat, juma ki raat, [Eid] Fitr ki raat, aur [Eid] Qurban [zabh] ki raat."
"50","[AI-translation] Jis ke han bachcha paida ho aur woh us ke daen kaan mein azan aur baen kaan mein iqamat kahe to umm-us-sibyan [bachchon ki ek beemari] use nuqsan nahin pahunchaegi."
"51","[AI-translation] Jo meri ummat ke bigad ke waqt meri sunnat ko mazbooti se pakde use sau shaheedon ka ajr milega."
"52","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke bigad ke waqt meri sunnat par jamne wale ke liye ek shaheed ka ajr hai."
"53","[AI-translation] Main do zabiheon ka beta hun [yani Ismail aur mere walid Abdullah]."
"54","[AI-translation] Mushaf ko dekhna ibadat hai, aulad ka walidain ko dekhna ibadat hai, aur Ali bin Abi Talib ko dekhna bhi ibadat hai."
"55","[AI-translation] Jis ne meri masjid mein chalis namazen is tarah padhin ke ek namaz bhi na chhooti, to us ke liye jahannam se azadi, azab se nijat likh di jaegi aur woh nifaq se bari hoga."
"56","[AI-translation] Qareebi rishtedar bhalai ke ziyada haqdar hain."
"57","[AI-translation] Jannat mein sab se aakhir dakhil hone wala [qabeela] Juhaina ka ek aadmi hoga, use Juhaina kaha jaega; jannat wale us se poochenge: Kya koi azab pane wala baqi hai? Woh kahega: Nahin. To woh kahenge: Juhaina ke paas yaqeeni khabar hai."
"58","[AI-translation] Behtareen naam woh hain jin mein bandagi [jaise Abdullah] aur hamd [jaise Muhammad aur Ahmad] ho."
"59","[AI-translation] Ilm hasil karo agarche [cheen] jana pade."
"60","[AI-translation] Un se mashwara karo, yani aurton se, lekin un ki mukhalifat karo [un ki rae par amal na karo]."
"61","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din log apni maaon [ke naam] se pukare jaenge, Allah Azza wa Jalla ki taraf se un par parda ke liye."
"62","[AI-translation] Badshah zameen par Allah ka saya hai; jo us ki khairkhwahi kare woh hidayat paya, aur jo use dhoka de woh gumrah hua."
"63","[AI-translation] Jo Allah se dare Allah har cheez ko us se dara dega; aur jo Allah se na dare to Allah use har cheez se dara dega."
"64","[AI-translation] Allah Tabaraka wa Ta'ala farmata hai: Jo Mere faisle par razi na ho aur Meri aazmaish par sabr na kare to woh Mere siwa koi Rabb talash kar le."
"65","[AI-translation] Fasiq ki ghibat [ghibat] nahin [khule fasiq ki burai bayan karna mamnu ghibat nahin]."
"66","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi mar jae aur tum use dafan karo to tum mein se ek us ke sar ke paas khada ho aur kahe: Aey falan bin falanah! Kyunke woh sunega. Phir kahe: Aey falan bin falanah! Kyunke woh seedha baith jaega. Phir kahe: Aey falan bin falanah! Kyunke woh kahega: Mujhe rahnumai karo, mujhe rahnumai karo, Allah tum par rehem kare. Phir kahe: Yaad karo jis par tum duniya ke ghar se nikle: gawahi ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Woh akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahin, aur Muhammad Us ke bande aur Rasool hain, aur qayamat aane wali hai is mein koi shak nahin, aur Allah qabron walon ko uthae ga ...!"
"67","[AI-translation] Jo istikhara kare woh nakam na hua, jo mashwara kare woh nadim na hua, aur jo kifayat-shi'ari kare woh muflis na hua."
"68","[AI-translation] Woh jab apne baal katwate ya nakhun tarashte ya pichhne lagwate to unhen Baqi' bhej dete phir wahan dafan kar diye jate."
"69","[AI-translation] Momin zaheen, samajhdar aur hoshiyar hota hai."
"70","[AI-translation] Aey logon! Beshak tum par ek azeem mahine ka saya pad gaya hai, aisa mahina jis mein ek raat hai jo hazar mahinon [ki ibadat] se behtar hai; Allah ne us ke rozon ko farz aur us ki raat ke qiyam [tarawih] ko nafl kiya; jo is mein ek neki se qurb hasil kare woh us ki tarah hai jis ne kisi aur mahine mein farz ada kiya; aur jo is mein farz ada kare woh us ki tarah hai jis ne kisi aur mahine mein sattar farz ada kiye; yeh sabr ka mahina hai aur sabr ka badla jannat hai; hamdardi ka mahina hai; aisa mahina jis mein momin ke rizq mein izafa kiya jata hai; jo is mein rozedar ko iftar karae us ke gunah bakhsh diye jaenge, us ki gardan jahannam se azad hogi, aur use us [rozedar] ke barabar ajr milega baghair is ke ke us ke ajr mein kami ho. Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham mein se har ek ke paas rozedar ko iftar karane ka saman nahin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah yeh sawab use dega jo rozedar ko doodh ka ek ghoont, ek khajoor, ya pani ka ek ghoont iftar karae; aur jo rozedar ko pet bhar khilade Allah use mere hauz se pilaega, jis ke baad woh jannat mein dakhil hone tak kabhi pyasa na hoga; yeh aisa mahina hai jis ka awwal rehmat hai, darmiyan maghfirat hai, aur aakhir jahannam se azadi hai; aur jo is mein apne ghulam par bojh halka kare Allah use bakhsh dega aur jahannam se azad karega."
"71","[AI-translation] Aey Jibreel! Mere liye aag aur jahannam ka haal bayan karo. To Jibreel ne kaha: Beshak Allah Tabaraka wa Ta'ala ne jahannam ka hukm diya, to use hazar saal jalaya gaya yahan tak ke safed ho gayi; phir hukm diya gaya to use hazar saal jalaya gaya yahan tak ke surkh ho gayi; phir hukm diya gaya to use hazar saal jalaya gaya yahan tak ke kaali ho gayi; to woh kaali tareek hai."
"72","[AI-translation] Allah ke zikr ke baghair kasrat se baat na karo, kyunke Allah ke zikr ke baghair kasrat-e-kalam dil ki sakhti hai; aur Allah se sab se door sakht dil wala hai."
"73","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi saf tak pahunche jabke saf poori ho chuki ho, to woh saf se ek aadmi ko apni taraf kheench le aur use apne pehlu mein khada kare."
"74","[AI-translation] Is ummat mein abdal tees honge, Ibrahim Khalil-ur-Rahman (Alaihissalam) ki tarah; jab un mein se ek mard faut ho jaega, Allah Tabaraka wa Ta'ala us ki jagah [doosra] mard bhej dega."
"75","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr tum se kasrat-e-roza aur namaz se aage nahin badhe, balke us cheez se jo un ke seene mein thi [iman aur taqwa]."
"76","[AI-translation] Baitullah ki tehiyyat tawaf hai."
"77","[AI-translation] Beshak banda jab namaz mein khada hota hai to woh Rahman ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan hota hai [Us ki nigrani mein]; phir agar woh idhar udhar dekhe, Rabb us se farmata hai: Aey Adam ke bete! Tu kis ki taraf dekhta hai? Kya us ki taraf jo Tere liye Mujh se behtar hai? Aey Adam ke bete! Apni namaz ki taraf mutawajjeh ho, Main tere liye us se behtar hun jis ki taraf tu dekhta hai."
"78","[AI-translation] Musa ke dil mein khayal aaya: Kya Allah Ta'ala sota hai? To Allah ne un ki taraf ek farishta bheja, phir use teen martaba [teen din] sulaya, phir use sheeshe ki do botalen din, har hath mein ek botal ... phir woh so gaya, to us ke dono hath hile aur dono botalen toot gayin. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne use misaal di ke agar Allah sota to aasman aur zameen qayam na rehte."
"79","[AI-translation] [Ghair mehram ko] dekhna Iblees ke teeron mein se ek teer hai; jo Allah ke khauf se use chhor de Allah use aisa iman dega jis ki mithas woh apne dil mein paega."
"80","[AI-translation] Behte hue nakseer se wuzu dohraya jaega."
"81","[AI-translation] Iman tamanna aur zewar [zahiri] ka naam nahin, balke woh hai jo dil mein tehre aur amal us ki tasdeeq kare."
"82","[AI-translation] Ek janwar niklega jis ke paas Musa (Alaihissalam) ka asa aur Sulaiman (Alaihissalam) ki angoothi hogi, phir woh kahega: Yeh [momin] hai, yeh [kafir] hai."
"83","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr ghaar ki taraf gae aur us mein dakhil hue; phir ek makdi aai aur ghaar ke munh par jaala bun diya; Quraish Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko talash karte aae, aur jab unhon ne ghaar ke munh par makdi ka jaala dekha to kaha: Is mein koi dakhil nahin hua ..."
"84","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek bu mehsoos farmai, to farmaya: Is bu wala khada ho aur wuzu kare. Woh aadmi khada hone se sharmaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is bu wala khada ho aur wuzu kare, kyunke Allah haq se haya nahin farmata. To Abbas ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham sab khade ho kar wuzu na karen? To Aap ne farmaya: Tum sab khade ho aur wuzu karo."
"85","[AI-translation] Jab meri ummat pandrah khaslaten ikhtiyar kare to un par balaa utregi: jab maal-e-ghaneemat zaati milkiyat ban jae, amanat ko maal-e-ghaneemat samjha jae, zakat ko jurmana samjha jae, aadmi apni biwi ki itaat kare aur maan ki nafarmani kare, dost se bhalai kare aur baap se doori kare, masjidon mein awazen buland hon, qaum ka sardar un mein sab se zaleel ho, aadmi ki izzat us ke shar ke khauf se ki jae, sharab pi jae, resham pehna jae, ganewaliyan aur aalaat-e-moseeqi ikhtiyar kiye jaen, aur is ummat ke pichhle aglon par la'nat karen; to us waqt surkh aandhi, zameen mein dhansne, aur shaklen badalne ka intezar karo."
"86","[AI-translation] Duniya ki mohabbat har gunah ki jad hai."
"87","[AI-translation] Halal talash karna jihad hai, aur Beshak Allah hunar-mand momin se mohabbat farmata hai."
"88","[AI-translation] Har cheez ki dulhan hoti hai, aur Quran ki dulhan [surah] Rahman hai."
"89","[AI-translation] Qaum ka sardar un ka khadim hai."
"90","[AI-translation] Do shifa dene wali cheezon ko lazmi pakdo: shehed aur Quran."
"91","[AI-translation] Umayyah bin Abi Salt ki sha'iri iman lai, lekin us ka dil kafir raha."
"92","[AI-translation] Neki purani nahin hoti, gunah bhoola nahin jata, aur [Allah] hisab lene wala sota nahin; to jaise chaaho ban jaao, jaise karoge waise badla paoge."
"93","[AI-translation] Malak-ul-maut ka samna talwar ki hazar zarbon se sakht hai."
"94","[AI-translation] Saat [cheezon] se pahle a'mal mein jaldi karo: kya tum bhoola dene wale faqr, sarkash banane wali daulat, bigad dene wali beemari, aql zail karne wale budhape, khatm karne wali maut, intezar kiye jane wale ghaibon mein sab se bure Dajjal, ya qayamat ka intezar kar rahe ho; to qayamat sab se sakht aur sab se kadwi hai."
"95","[AI-translation] Tum mein sab se jurrat se fatwa dene wala tum mein jahannam mein jane mein sab se jurrat wala hai."
"96","[AI-translation] Momin ki firasat se daro, kyunke woh Allah ke noor se dekhta hai."
"97","[AI-translation] Duniya us ka ghar hai jis ka koi ghar nahin, us ka maal hai jis ka koi maal nahin, aur use sirf woh jama karta hai jis ke paas aql nahin."
"98","[AI-translation] Pani ko apne khane ka aakhri hissa na banao [khane ke aakhir mein pani na piyo]."
"99","[AI-translation] Beshak dilon ko zang lagta hai jaise lohe ko zang lagta hai, aur un ka jila istighfar [maghfirat mangna] hai."
"100","[AI-translation] Ham chhote jihad se bade jihad ki taraf laut aae hain."
"101","[AI-translation] Jis ne Ramazan ke kisi din baghair us rukhsat ke jo Allah ne di hai roza toda, to agar woh saari umar roza rakhe tab bhi us din ki qaza na hogi."
"102","[AI-translation] Beshak Abdur Rahman bin Auf ghisat kar jannat mein dakhil honge."
"103","[AI-translation] Allah ke han halal cheezon mein sab se napasandeeda talaq hai."
"104","[AI-translation] Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef lae to aurten, bachche aur laundiyan yeh kehne lagi: Ham par chaand tulu ho gaya, ham par shukr wajib ho gaya ... aey hamare darmiyan bheje hue Saniyyat-ul-Wada ki taraf se ... jab tak Allah ki taraf bulane wala bulata rahe, Tum aisa hukm lae jo itaat kiya jata hai."
"105","[AI-translation] Hasad se bacho, kyunke hasad nekiyon ko is tarah kha jata hai jaise aag lakdi ko khati hai."
"106","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Main Allah hun, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin, badshahon ka Malik, Shahenshah; badshahon ke dil Mere hath mein hain; aur Beshak jab Mere bande Meri itaat karte hain Main un ke badshahon ke dil un ki taraf narmi aur rehmat se pher deta hun; aur jab Mere bande Meri nafarmani karte hain Main un ke badshahon ke dil un ki taraf ghazab aur inteqam se pher deta hun, phir woh unhen sakht azab chakhate hain; to apne badshahon par bad-dua mein apne aap ko mashghool na karo, balke Mere zikr aur aajizi mein mashghool raho, Main tumhare badshahon se tumhari hifazat karunga."
"107","[AI-translation] Naumaulood bachche ke kaan mein azan aur iqamat kehna."
"108","[AI-translation] Hikmat har dana ki gumshuda cheez hai; jab woh use pa le to woh us ka sab se ziyada haqdar hai."
